# Docker build context exclusions.
#
# Keep the context small AND avoid clobbering in-container build output:
#   - `ui/dist` and `ui/node_modules` are produced/installed inside the UI
#     stage; the host copies must never be copied in.
#   - `target/` is produced by the builder stage.
# The `ui/` *source* (package.json, lockfile, src, configs) IS kept.

# Rust build artifacts
target/

# Frontend build artifacts & dependencies (built inside their stages)
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/
ui/coverage/

# VCS / local state / secrets
.git/
.gitignore
data/
.env
.env.*

# Docs, plans and packaging files not needed inside the image
plans/
docs/
*.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
